\par \pard\plain \s2\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs36\ab\sb200\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs36\b\ql\sb200\sa120\ltrpar{\loch
Structural Reform of Children\u8217\'92s Digital Access and the Regulation of Converged }{\rtlch\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs36\ab \ltrch\fs36\b\loch
Internet}{\loch
 Ecosystems }
\par \pard\plain \s24\afs12\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\fs12\ql\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\ltrpar\loch

\par \pard\plain \s2\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs36\ab\sb200\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs36\b\ql\sb200\sa120\ltrpar{\loch
1. Respondent Information}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
This submission is provided as an individual response to consultation on children\u8217\'92s online safety and digital platform regulation.}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
It addresses structural risks arising from children\u8217\'92s exposure to converged, account-based, algorithmically mediated digital ecosystems }{\loch
operating on the public internet}{\loch
, and proposes a system-level redesign of access boundaries between minors and the public internet.}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\ql\ltrpar{\loch
Subsequent updates and refinements to this proposal will be maintained in a version-controlled public repository}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\ql\ltrpar{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://github.com/The-digital-gardener/digital-access-boundaries-framework" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\langfe255\alang255\cf9\lang255\ul\ulc0\loch
https://github.com/The-digital-gardener/digital-access-boundaries-framework}}}}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\ql\ltrpar{\loch
A supporting monograph expanding the structural and technical basis of this proposal is in development and will be published to the same repository in due course. }
\par \pard\plain \s24\afs12\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\fs12\ql\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\ltrpar\loch

\par \pard\plain \s1\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs48\ab\sb240\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs48\b\ql\sb240\sa120\ltrpar{\loch
2. Executive Summary}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
Current regulatory approaches are structurally insufficient because they focus on platform categories such as \u8220\'93social media\u8221\'94, which are no longer stable due to convergence across digital systems.}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
Modern digital ecosystems increasingly integrate:}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls13 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
communication }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls13 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
commerce }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls13 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
entertainment }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls13 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
content delivery }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls13 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\ltrpar{\loch
behavioural profiling and recommendation systems }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\ql\ltrpar{\loch
As a result, harm arises not from isolated platform types but from shared system architecture across the public internet as a unified environment.}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
A further structural difficulty is that attempts to identify and regulate specific categories of online harm are increasingly unstable within converged digital ecosystems.}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
Many current policy approaches assume that harms can be isolated to identifiable platform types or services. In practice:}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls14 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
harmful exposure pathways exist across multiple categories of systems }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls14 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
platforms continuously evolve or reclassify functionality }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls14 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
new interaction and exploitation models emerge faster than regulatory adaptation cycles }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls14 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\ltrpar{\loch
globally distributed network environments limit the effectiveness of jurisdiction-specific containment approaches }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\ql\ltrpar{\loch
Additionally, it is often difficult to determine whether observed harms arise from specific services themselves or from broader cultural and behavioural conditions produced by persistent exposure to converged }{\loch
internet-enabled}{\loch
 environments.}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
As a result:}
\par \pard\plain \s25\li567\ri567\lin567\rin567\fi0\sb0\sa283\ql\li567\ri567\lin567\rin567\fi0\sb0\sa283\ltrpar{\loch
platform-specific regulation is likely to remain structurally incomplete, while the underlying sources of harm remain difficult to isolate with precision.}
\par \pard\plain \s24\afs12\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\fs12\ql\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\ltrpar\loch

\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs28\ab\sb140\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs28\b\ql\sb140\sa120\ltrpar{\loch
Core conclusion}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
The relevant regulatory unit is therefore not \u8220\'93social media\u8221\'94 or any individual platform category, but the public internet as an integrated socio-technical environment.}
\par \pard\plain \s24\afs12\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\fs12\ql\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\ltrpar\loch

\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs28\ab\sb140\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs28\b\ql\sb140\sa120\ltrpar{\loch
Proposed policy response}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
This submission proposes a structural separation between technological education and participation in the public internet during developmental years.}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
It is important to clarify that this proposal is explicitly pro-technology, not anti-technology.}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
The proposal does not seek to reduce children\u8217\'92s access to computing, software, artificial intelligence systems, or technical education. Instead, it seeks to separate technological capability development from exposure to converged public internet ecosystems.}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
The proposed framework establishes:}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls15 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
absolute restriction of public internet access for under-16s }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls15 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
full replacement with closed, school-governed digital environments }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls15 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
offline-first and sandboxed digital education as the primary learning environment }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls15 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\ltrpar{\loch
delayed first access to the public internet at eligibility age }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\ql\ltrpar{\loch
This is not a supervision model. It is a categorical access boundary model.}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar\loch

\par \pard\plain \s24\afs12\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\fs12\ql\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\ltrpar\loch

\par \pard\plain \s2\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs36\ab\sb200\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs36\b\ql\sb200\sa120\ltrpar{\loch
3. Problem Definition}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs28\ab\sb140\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs28\b\ql\sb140\sa120\ltrpar{\loch
3.1 Structural nature of digital harm}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
Children\u8217\'92s exposure to converged digital systems produces systemic harms arising from:}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls2 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
erosion of trust-based social environments }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls2 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
algorithmic amplification of emotionally extreme or engaging content }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls2 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
behavioural profiling and adaptive content shaping }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls2 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\ltrpar{\loch
attention-optimised economic incentives driving system design }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
These effects are systemic properties of the public internet environment rather than individual platform failures.}
\par \pard\plain \s24\afs12\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\fs12\ql\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\ltrpar\loch

\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs28\ab\sb140\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs28\b\ql\sb140\sa120\ltrpar{\loch
3.2 Failure of platform-based regulation}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
Regulation based on platform categories is structurally unstable because digital systems evade classification through:}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls3 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
rebranding and functional relabelling }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls3 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
modular separation of features across services }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls3 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
embedding social, commercial, and content systems within hybrid platforms }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls3 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\ltrpar{\loch
continuous convergence of interaction modalities }
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs28\ab\sb140\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs28\b\ql\sb140\sa120\ltrpar{\loch
Key structural issue:}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\rtlch \ltrch\cs16\ab\b\loch
Any definition of \u8220\'93social media\u8221\'94 or similar categories based on features is inherently evadable in converged systems.}
\par \pard\plain \s24\afs12\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\fs12\ql\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\ltrpar\loch

\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs28\ab\sb140\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs28\b\ql\sb140\sa120\ltrpar{\loch
3.3 Convergence beyond social media}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
Risk is not limited to communication platforms.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs24\ab\sb120\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs24\b\ql\sb120\sa120\ltrpar{\loch
Online commerce systems}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
Large-scale marketplaces now include:}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls4 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
algorithmic recommendation engines }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls4 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
behavioural profiling systems }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls4 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\ltrpar{\loch
persuasive interface design optimised for conversion }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
These systems actively shape:}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls5 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
consumption behaviour }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls5 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
preference formation }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls5 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\ltrpar{\loch
attention allocation }
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs24\ab\sb120\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs24\b\ql\sb120\sa120\ltrpar{\loch
Unified ecosystem structures}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
Modern platforms increasingly integrate:}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls6 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
communication }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls6 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
commerce }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls6 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
content consumption }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls6 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
payment systems }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls6 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\ltrpar{\loch
social interaction }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
into single }{\loch
public in}{\loch
t}{\loch
ernet }{\loch
account-based environments.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs28\ab\sb140\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs28\b\ql\sb140\sa120\ltrpar{\loch
Structural implication:}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\rtlch \ltrch\cs16\ab\b\loch
The distinction between \u8220\'93social media\u8221\'94, \u8220\'93commerce platform\u8221\'94, and \u8220\'93content system\u8221\'94 is no longer functionally meaningful.}
\par \pard\plain \s24\afs12\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\fs12\ql\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\ltrpar\loch

\par \pard\plain \s2\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs36\ab\sb200\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs36\b\ql\sb200\sa120\ltrpar{\loch
4. Policy Objectives}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
The policy aims to:}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls7 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
eliminate under-16 exposure to the public internet as a developmental environment }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls17 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx720\li720\ri0\lin720\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
preserve and strengthen digital literacy through closed, structured educational systems }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls18 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx720\li720\ri0\lin720\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
separate technological capability development from exposure to public internet ecosystems during formative stages }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls19 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx720\li720\ri0\lin720\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
replace unsupervised access with bounded, institutionally governed digital environments }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls20 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx720\li720\ri0\lin720\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
regulate digital risk through system-level access conditions rather than platform-based classification }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls21 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx720\li720\ri0\lin720\rin0\fi-283\ltrpar{\loch
support the development of clearer societal expectations around acceptable online behaviour by structurally distinguishing educational digital environments from public internet participation during developmental stages, establishing bounded conditions that enable later independent and responsible digital engagement }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\ql\ltrpar\loch

\par \pard\plain \s24\afs12\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\fs12\ql\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\ltrpar\loch

\par \pard\plain \s2\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs36\ab\sb200\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs36\b\ql\sb200\sa120\ltrpar{\loch
5. Proposed Policy Framework}
\par \pard\plain \s24\afs12\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\fs12\ql\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\ltrpar\loch

\par \pard\plain \s1\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs48\ab\sb240\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs48\b\ql\sb240\sa120\ltrpar{\rtlch \ltrch\cs16\ab\b\b\loch
5. Proposed Policy Framework}
\par \pard\plain \s2\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs36\ab\sb200\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs36\b\ql\sb200\sa120\ltrpar{\rtlch \ltrch\cs16\ab\b\b\loch
5.1 Core principle: separation of systems}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
This framework establishes a strict separation between:}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\rtlch \ltrch\cs16\ab\b\loch
A. The public internet}{\loch
\line A global, open, account-based, algorithmically mediated socio-technical environment integrating communication, commerce, and content systems.}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\rtlch \ltrch\cs16\ab\b\loch
B. Educational digital environments}{\loch
\line Closed, institutionally governed systems designed exclusively for learning, computational development, and structured digital capability formation.}
\par \pard\plain \s24\afs12\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\fs12\ql\sb0\sa283\brdrb\brdrdb\brdrw1\brdrcf15\brsp0\noline\ltrpar\loch

\par \pard\plain \s2\dbch\af7\dbch\af8\afs36\ab\sb200\sa120\keepn\loch\f3\fs36\b\ql\sb200\sa120\ltrpar{\rtlch \ltrch\cs16\ab\b\b\loch
5.2 Absolute restriction: under-16 access to the public internet}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
Under-16s should have no access to the public internet in any form, whether supervised or unsupervised.}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl276\slmult1\ql\sb0\sa140\ltrpar{\loch
This includes:}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls22 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
open web browsing }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls22 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
social media systems }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls22 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
online marketplaces }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls22 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
algorithmically mediated content feeds }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls22 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\ltrpar{\loch
any public internet account-based services }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\ql\ltrpar{\rtlch \ltrch\cs16\ab\b\loch
Implementation mechanism:}
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls23 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\loch
restriction of access through prohibition on unrestricted internet-enabled general-purpose devices for under-16s }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140{\listtext\pard\plain \dbch\af5\dbch\af5\loch\f5 \u8226\'95\tab}\ilvl0\ls23 \li0\ri0\lin0\rin0\fi-283\ql\tx707\li707\ri0\lin707\rin0\fi-283\ltrpar{\loch
requirement that all digital use occurs within approved closed educational environments that are not connected to the public internet }
\par \pard\plain \s20\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\ql\ltrpar{\rtlch \ltrch\cs16\ab\b\loch
Key principle:}{\loch
\line The public internet is not an educational environment for minors.}
